{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己找出怎样喜欢才不会受伤，先停下反复盘算该收住还是放开。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复盘算\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想让对方自己愿意靠近，不想让对方为了安抚他才给出答复。\",\n      \"key\": \"自己愿意靠近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"text\": \"虽仍没有答案，安心靠近、真心给予、独自珍藏、尽情欢喜都曾让他快乐，也让他知道这个人有多重要。\",\n      \"key\": \"这个人有多重要\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"text\": \"以后若等不到对方主动靠近，他还是会疼，这不等于他先前的喜欢是假的。\",\n      \"key\": \"还是会疼\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍想被这个人选择，也愿继续喜欢，不再靠收住心意证明自己没陷进去。\",\n      \"key\": \"证明自己没陷进去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-1\", \"S14-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再寻找无风险爱法、停止反复权衡和承认未来仍可能受伤的意思。将 S14-1 的前因改接到 S13-3、S13-4，不再用想被珍惜的心会回来作为停止权衡的直接理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\", \"R67\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-2\", \"S14-3\", \"S14-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他仍盼被这个人选择、希望对方出于自己的意愿靠近的心情，并明确过去的快乐让他知道这个人有多重要。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R70\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留四种不同的快乐及其对继续喜欢的意义，让回顾不只是重复旧经历。将安心靠近、真心给予、独自珍藏、尽情欢喜分别接回前面真正发生过的经历，并以仍没有答案保留未解决感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R71\", \"R72\", \"R73\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-4\", \"S14-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留未来可能疼痛、对方的选择不能判定喜欢真假、他仍愿继续喜欢的意思。删去重复的原则宣言，压缩对开头的复述，并明确他不再靠收住心意证明自己没陷进去；此处的改变由 S11-2 对真心与渴望的重新认识提供理由。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ef5ab800-05d2-4037-a5d2-5c6e55faa768", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T134419048859Z", "elapsed_seconds": 760.203, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T13:56:59.265881+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "daae9f5d7c61765a54f397b2fea11942a09217c61d02e48f972decda1752bce5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_